### 1. Tạo mới User
POST http://localhost:3001/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "age": 20
}

### 2. Lấy danh sách tất cả Users
GET http://localhost:3001/api/users

### 3. Lấy chi tiết 1 User theo ID
GET http://localhost:3001/api/users/USER_ID_O_DAY

### 4. Cập nhật thông tin User
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/users/USER_ID_O_DAY
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe Updated",
  "age": 25
}

### 5. Xóa User
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/users/USER_ID_O_DAY
